title Home Assistant: Connecting: signed in, but the server does not answer yet at start (nothing loaded)
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO connecting

wait 800
shot connecting
check connecting
expect text "Connecting..."
expect text "Ceiling light"
expect noquit
